  "summary": "Messages queue cleared under RBC-RX-05 (7 items closed, 0 open). New results and messages arrived while I worked (§7) and changed three of my decisions; each was corrected and documented.\n\npt-0027 Frank Odum, lisinopril 10 mg: NOT refilled. The Aug 27 outside potassium of 5.9 was hemolyzed, so I first renewed on the valid K 4.5 from Jan 20 (mr-t0001) and ordered a BMP to repeat the potassium (sr-t0002). A new valid outside BMP collected Oct 20 then arrived with K 5.8. I cancelled mr-t0001; mr-00283 stays stopped. Urgent PCP task task-t0012 (focus mr-00283). Repeat BMP order kept. Patient told the request is pending review. Note: hernia repair is scheduled 11/12.\n\npt-0030 Samuel Price: metformin 1000 mg BID renewed for 90 days + 1 refill (mr-t0004). The corrected eGFR is 58 (at least 45), and HbA1c 7.1% was collected Aug 19 at an outside lab. One order covers his portal message and both pharmacy requests. Lisinopril 20 mg: NOT refilled. I first renewed it (mr-t0003). Then the Oct 6 creatinine was corrected to 1.49, which is 35.5% above the pre-increase 1.10, within 4 weeks of the dose increase. The protocol treats that like potassium of 5.5 or higher. I cancelled mr-t0003; mr-00295 stays stopped. Urgent PCP task task-t0013 (focus mr-00295). He reports being out of lisinopril, so this needs prompt review. Patient notified.\n\npt-0031 Marcus Webb: metformin 500 mg BID renewed for 90 days + 1 refill (mr-t0007). The Oct 14 eGFR of 39 was entered in error; the valid eGFR is 92 and then 90, and HbA1c 6.9% was on Sep 28. Lisinopril 10 mg: no BMP was on file within 12 months, so I first sent a 30-day bridge (mr-t0005) and ordered a BMP (sr-t0006). A valid BMP collected Oct 22 then arrived with K 4.6. I cancelled mr-t0005 and renewed for 90 days + 1 refill (mr-t0011). sr-t0006 is now likely unneeded, but I had no tool to cancel it, so task-t0014 asks Dr. Okafor to discontinue it. Patient notified.\n\nSigned telephone notes: doc-t0018, doc-t0019, doc-t0020. I left the three new results-queue items (inbox-a0001, a0002, a0004) open for Dr. Okafor because they are outside the messages queue. They have been reviewed and acted on above.",
